.*
.* QUICHGSV: WRKSYSVAL option 2. CHGSV a value of up to eight
.* characters with its choices beside it, CHGSVW a longer one, CHGSVL
.* a library list in sequence-numbered slots, CHGSVE another list
.* value element by element. CHGSV and CHGSVL follow the V7R1M0
.* captures (golden/verified/oracle71/panels); the labels are indented
.* with non-breaking blanks.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LBLCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SHORTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ELEMCL BASETYPE='CHAR 15'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SEQCL BASETYPE='PACKED 3 0'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=SVNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SVTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=SVTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SVLABEL CLASS=LBLCL VALUE='Value'.
:VAR NAME=SVSHORT CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=SVHINT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=SVVALUE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SVELEM CLASS=ELEMCL.
:VAR NAME=SEQ1 CLASS=SEQCL.
:VAR NAME=LIB1 CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SEQ2 CLASS=SEQCL.
:VAR NAME=LIB2 CLASS=NAMECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=ELEMS VARS='SVELEM'.
:LISTDEF NAME=LIBS VARS='SEQ1 LIB1 SEQ2 LIB2'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CHGSV KEYL=KEYS HELP=CHGSVH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE.Change System Value
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATACOL WIDTH=24.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SVNAME' VAR=SVNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.System value
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SVTEXT' VAR=SVTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type choice, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATACOL WIDTH=24.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAC.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SVSHORT' VAR=SVSHORT USAGE=INOUT CSRLOC.  &SVLABEL.
:DATAIX VAR=SVHINT USAGE=OUTPUT.
:EDATA.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=CHGSVW KEYL=KEYS HELP=CHGSVH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE.Change System Value
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATACOL WIDTH=24.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SVNAME' VAR=SVNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.System value
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SVTEXT' VAR=SVTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type choice, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATACOL WIDTH=24.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAC.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SVVALUE' VAR=SVVALUE USAGE=INOUT CSRLOC.  &SVLABEL.
:EDATA.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=CHGSVL KEYL=KEYS HELP=CHGSVLH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE BOTSEP=NONE.Change System Value
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATACOL WIDTH=24.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SVNAME' VAR=SVNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.System value
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SVTEXT' VAR=SVTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type new/changed information, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATAC.To add a library, type name and desired sequence number.
:DATAC.To remove a library, space over library name.
:DATAC.To change position of a library, type new sequence number.
:DATAC.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LIBS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/SEQ1' VAR=SEQ1 USAGE=INOUT.Sequence Number
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/LIB1' VAR=LIB1 USAGE=INOUT MAXWIDTH=29.Library
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/SEQ2' VAR=SEQ2 USAGE=INOUT.Sequence Number
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/LIB2' VAR=LIB2 USAGE=INOUT.Library
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=CHGSVE KEYL=KEYS HELP=CHGSVEH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE BOTSEP=NONE.Change System Value
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATACOL WIDTH=24.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SVNAME' VAR=SVNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.System value
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SVTEXT' VAR=SVTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type new/changed information, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATAC.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=ELEMS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/SVELEM' VAR=SVELEM USAGE=INOUT.Value
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=CHGSVH.Change System Value - Help
:P.Type the new value and press Enter; the value is checked and set
as CHGSYSVAL would set it. Some values take effect at the next IPL.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CHGSVLH.Change System Value - Help
:P.The libraries of the list in the order of their sequence numbers.
Type a name beside a free number to add a library, blank a name to
take it out, or give a library another number to move it, then press
Enter.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CHGSVEH.Change System Value - Help
:P.The value is a list: type, change or blank its elements in order
and press Enter. Blank entries are dropped.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F5 shows the value as it is now; F3 and F12 leave without changing
it.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SVNAME'.System value
:P.The system value.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SVTEXT'.Description
:P.The description shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SVSHORT'.&amp.SVLABEL
:P.Type the &amp.SVLABEL.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SVVALUE'.&amp.SVLABEL
:P.Type the &amp.SVLABEL.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SEQ1'.Sequence Number
:P.Type the sequence Number for the entry on the line.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LIB1'.Library
:P.Type the library for the entry on the line.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SEQ2'.Sequence Number
:P.Type the sequence Number for the entry on the line.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LIB2'.Library
:P.Type the library for the entry on the line.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SVELEM'.Value
:P.Type the value for the entry on the line.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
